      "writtenOn": "2021-10-01T02:34:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "good point, shared_mem_release() should be called only in case total_read_count is non zero, I added the check.\n\nI can rearrange the code if you insist, but I really am trying to avoid code duplication to keep the code size addition to the minimum. Also, it seems to me that the complexity of handling write and then read will still be there in process_write_read_request().\n\nCan you take a look at the result and see that maybe it is clear enough now?",
      "parentUuid": "ead65bda_ca88edce",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 644,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 644,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "0dc5e657759e133fc521617135f8c4c41b35280b",
